00:06:17.792 --> 00:06:19.047
A defense attorney.
- Mm-hmm.

00:06:19.047 --> 00:06:23.261
- And she's got like
her kids and everything.

00:06:23.261 --> 00:06:25.872
And I'm like a blast from the past.

00:06:25.872 --> 00:06:27.947
