what you're talking about.

00:07:23.553 --> 00:07:25.380
- Yeah.
(Kelly laughing)

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:28.429
Yeah. It was kind of a
magical project in that way,

00:07:28.429 --> 00:07:31.597
